Title: Calculate Concentration and Dispersion in Ordered Rating Scales
Authors@R: c(person(given = "Didier",
                  family = "Ruedin",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "didier.ruedin@unine.ch",
                  comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5213-4316")),
              person(given = "Clem",
